uit order granting motion to strike out certain allegations in the complaint, plaintiff appeals.\nMessrs. Thomas & Gibbes, for appellant.\nMessrs. Bellinger} Tozwisend & Haskell, contra.\nMarch 6, 1905."}, "file_name": "0016-01", "first_page_order": 28, "last_page_order": 29}